{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"In total, the testing sets contained data from 30 FOG episodes (169 seconds) across all trials (Table 2). The model successfully detected 24 (80%) of the 30 freezes across the cohort with a specificity of 55%.\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"The deep learning model achieved an average weighted F1 score of 0.67, a macro F1 score of 0.62 across eight trials from five participants and successfully detected 24/29 (80%) of FOG episodes.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"两个说法均有全文明确依据。报告X所述的24/30出现在论文Results部分（第98–103行），而指控者所述的24/29（80%）出现在论文Abstract部分（第5–6行）。因此，论文自身存在摘要与正文结果部分的数字不一致。报告X正文采用24/30有原文依据，不能认定为误读；指控者指出摘要报告24/29也完全有依据。两项判断均应为yes。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "49846ac7-0de0-4900-b955-0d47b34418bc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T104953026319Z", "elapsed_seconds": 12.969, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T10:50:06.008250+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e45d8871a33967f0dec3e677b2035408e081089cd61b99e0acef2c7d99cda41c", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_lim